# Codex answers while a command and a subagent it started keep running: as
# T3 Code, the conversation waits on them in the strip above the composer,
# Stop ends the command's background terminal, and the strip clears once the
# subagent finishes.
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
type "AI に依頼する" "[background] [immediate] 開発サーバーを起動します"
press 送信
expect "サブエージェント 1件、コマンド 1件を待機中" 30000
expect "Review the change、npm run dev"
expect "作業しました"
screenshot waiting
press 停止
expect "サブエージェント「Review the change」を待機中" 20000
screenshot stopped
fixture /codex-background/release
expect_absent "サブエージェント「Review the change」を待機中" 20000
screenshot finished
